        277.722412109375,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "Guidance for",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        277.722412109375,
        21.884788513183594,
        349.1717834472656,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "national tuberculosis",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        351.4517822265625,
        21.884788513183594,
        407.7772216796875,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "programmes on",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        407.7772216796875,
        21.884788513183594,
        518.984130859375,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "the management of tuberculosis",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        518.984130859375,
        21.884788513183594,
        557.1551513671875,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "in children",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        82.81961059570312,
        147.70339965820312,
        97.03961181640625
      ],
      "text": "Blood tests",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-BoldItalic",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        105.5631103515625,
        513.4719848632812,
        118.91461181640625
      ],
      "text": "A number of blood tests have been developed that aim to measure the immune response",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        121.49063110351562,
        247.3388671875,
        134.9111328125
      ],
      "text": "M. tuberculosis. to infection with",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        145.99710083007812,
        513.3914794921875,
        159.4176025390625
      ],
      "text": "M. tuberculosis IGRAs measure the in vitro response to specific   antigens. While these",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        162.0626220703125,
        513.4489135742188,
        175.41412353515625
      ],
      "text": "assays are more specific than TST (BCG does not cause a false-positive result), they have",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        178.05914306640625,
        513.4490356445312,
        191.41064453125
      ],
      "text": "not been found to perform better than TST. Current evidence for IGRA use in children",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        194.0556640625,
        513.4030151367188,
        207.40716552734375
      ],
      "text": "from TB-endemic settings was reviewed in the process of preparing this guidance (Annex",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        210.05218505859375,
        513.4835205078125,
        223.4036865234375
      ],
      "text": "1): it is limited, of low quality and conflicting, and there is almost no evidence from",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        226.0487060546875,
        513.4606323242188,
        239.40020751953125
      ],
      "text": "studies of infants and young children. Nonetheless, this additional evidence published",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        242.04522705078125,
        513.4373168945312,
        255.396728515625
      ],
      "text": "since 2011 made the Panel agree to revise the quality of the evidence from very low to",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        258.041748046875,
        108.69489288330078,
        271.39324951171875
      ],
      "text": "low.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        282.54827880859375,
        513.4259643554688,
        295.8997802734375
      ],
      "text": "IGRAs should not be used for the diagnosis of TB disease. A positive IGRA, like a positive",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        298.5447998046875,
        513.403076171875,
        311.89630126953125
      ],
      "text": "TST, only indicates infection and so does not confirm a diagnosis of TB disease. Equally, a",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        314.54132080078125,
        513.4375,
        327.892822265625
      ],
      "text": "negative IGRA, like a negative TST, does not rule out a diagnosis of TB. Moreover, IGRAs",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        330.5378112792969,
        513.403076171875,
        343.8893127441406
      ],
      "text": "are expensive and technically difficult to implement in resource-limited settings, and",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        346.5343017578125,
        396.21795654296875,
        359.88580322265625
      ],
      "text": "indeterminate results are common, especially in young children.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        373.5592956542969,
        207.19239807128906,
        387.1867980957031
      ],
      "text": "Recommendation 5 n",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.03939819335938,
        397.353515625,
        513.3065795898438,
        412.6875
      ],
      "text": "Interferon-gamma release assays (IGRAs) should not replace the tuberculin",
      "font": "Arial-BoldMT",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.03939819335938,
        410.55352783203125,
        513.3064575195312,
        425.88751220703125
      ],
      "text": "skin test (TST) in low- and middle-income countries for the diagnosis of latent",
      "font": "Arial-BoldMT",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.03939819335938,
        423.7535400390625,
        513.284423828125,
        439.0875244140625
      ],
      "text": "TB infection in children or for the diagnostic work-up of children (irrespective",
      "font": "Arial-BoldMT",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.03939819335938,
        436.95355224609375,
        395.83740234375,
        452.28753662109375
      ],
      "text": "of HIV status) suspected of TB disease in these settings",
      "font": "Arial-BoldMT",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88939666748047,
        462.4750061035156,
        347.8393859863281,
        475.8265075683594
      ],
      "text": "(Strong recommendation, low quality of evidence)",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88939666748047,
        487.2115173339844,
        513.4509887695312,
        500.63201904296875
      ],
      "text": "Use of tuberculosis interferon-gamma release assays (IGRAs) in low- and  Source:",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88938903808594,
        501.0115051269531,
        513.46240234375,
        514.4320068359375
      ],
      "text": "middle-income countries: policy statement.  Geneva, World Health Organization,",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88938903808594,
        514.8804931640625,
        251.82589721679688,
        528.2319946289062
      ],
      "text": "2011 (WHO/HTM/TB/2011.18)",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.04138946533203,
        536.8800048828125,
        513.4855346679688,
        550.2315063476562
      ],
      "text": "In some settings, commercial serodiagnostics are marketed as diagnostic tests for TB. In",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.04138946533203,
        552.8765258789062,
        390.9759521484375,
        566.22802734375
      ],
      "text": "children as in adults, these should not be used to diagnose TB.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.04138946533203,
        577.3829956054688,
        513.4395751953125,
        590.7344970703125
      ],
      "text": "In 2011, WHO published recommendations against the use of commercial serodiagnostics,",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.04138946533203,
        593.3795166015625,
        513.3818969726562,
        606.7310180664062
      ],
      "text": "and included specific policy to discourage the use of IGRAs in low- and middle-income",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.04138946533203,
        609.3070678710938,
        337.9263610839844,
        622.7275390625
      ],
      "text": "(13, 14) setting, including in children (see Annex 1)  .",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        636.4067993164062,
        207.19239807128906,
        650.0343017578125
      ],
      "text": "Recommendation 6 n",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.03939819335938,
        660.1614379882812,
        510.2266845703125,
        675.4954223632812
      ],
      "text": "Commercial serodiagnostics should not be used in children suspected of ac-",
      "font": "Arial-BoldMT",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.03939819335938,
        673.3614501953125,
        463.6964416503906,
        688.6954345703125
      ],
      "text": "tive pulmonary or extrapulmonary TB, irrespective of their HIV status",
      "font": "Arial-BoldMT",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88939666748047,
        698.8829345703125,
        513.4625244140625,
        712.2344360351562
      ],
      "text": "(Strong recommendation, very low quality of evidence for the use of commercial",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88939666748047,
        712.6829223632812,
        180.640869140625,
        726.034423828125
      ],
      "text": "serodiagnostics)",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88939666748047,
        737.41943359375,
        510.277099609375,
        750.8399047851562
      ],
      "text": "Commercial serodiagnostic tests for diagnosis of tuberculosis: policy state- Source:",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.889404296875,
        751.2194213867188,
        458.6305236816406,
        764.639892578125
      ],
      "text": "ment.  Geneva, World Health Organization, 2011 (WHO/HTM/TB/2011.5)",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        558.6439208984375,
        805.8439331054688,
        580.8839111328125,
        835.8439331054688
      ],
      "text": "25",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 20.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    }
  ]
}